{"sections":[{"slug":"SU(2)","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"SU(2)"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“SU(2)”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“SU(2)”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$SU(2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是行列式为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的二阶酉矩阵的乘法群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其元素形如</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{pmatrix}\r\n\\alpha &amp; \\beta \\\\\r\n-\\bar\\beta &amp; \\bar\\alpha\r\n\\end{pmatrix},\r\n|\\alpha|^2 + |\\beta|^2 = 1\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它也同构于单位四元数的乘法群</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群的同构</span> $SU(2)\\simeq \\text{Spin}(3)$ (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/自旋群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自旋群</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<p>$SU(2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极大环面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极大环面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是由对角矩阵</span> $\\begin{pmatrix}\t\\alpha&amp;\\\\&amp;\\bar\\alpha\\end{pmatrix} (|\\alpha|=1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成的同构于</span> $U(1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子群</span>.</p>\n<h2>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathfrak {su}(2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素形如</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{pmatrix}\r\n\tiz &amp; x+iy \\\\\r\n\t-x+iy &amp; -iz\r\n\\end{pmatrix},\r\nx,y,z\\in\\mathbb{R}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的同构</span> $\\mathfrak {sl}(2,\\mathbb{C})\\simeq\\mathfrak {su}(2)\\otimes_{\\mathbb{R}}\\mathbb{C}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">表示</span></h2>\n<p>$SU(2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示以自旋</span> $0,\\dfrac{1}{2},1,\\cdots$ <span lang=\"zh\">标记</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/sl2的表示","text":"sl2<span lang=\"zh\">的表示</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}